{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9a592907-96d9-4d07-b375-cf5a01e2dd57",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Gr√°ficos con Python"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "f578e4c2-52b9-41e8-b84b-d362fdccc2de",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "860b5bf3-b28f-4dd9-8d66-e5558df1ee65",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "44baf4e9-282e-45bf-8902-23951fb6769c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A partir del siguiente c√≥digo, intenta obtener el gr√°fico del dibujo."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "6f88dd95-cd53-4fca-9d9b-6c8a84014874",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "\n",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "n = 256\n",
    "X = np.linspace(-np.pi, np.pi, n, endpoint = True)\n",
    "Y = np.sin(2*X)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.plot(X, Y+1, color=\"blue\", alpha=1.00)\n",
    "plt.fill_between(X, 1, Y+1, color=\"blue\", alpha=0.25)\n",
    "plt.plot(X, Y-1, color=\"blue\", alpha=1.00)\n",
    "plt.fill_between(X, -1, Y-1, (Y-1) < -1, color=\"red\", alpha=0.25)\n",
    "plt.fill_between(X, -1, Y-1, (Y-1) > -1, color=\"blue\", alpha=0.25)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xlim(-np.pi, np.pi)\n",
    "plt.ylim(-2.5, 2.5)\n",
    "plt.xticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje X\n",
    "plt.yticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje Y\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e4e939a3-9cc4-4c32-baf5-b7f922035223",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pista: investiga el par√°metro `fill_between` de `matplotlib`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8553e27f-591a-4beb-9b17-51ac40421eb0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Pregunta 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5564e171-c508-4721-9976-40a34198a365",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A partir del siguiente c√≥digo, intenta obtener el gr√°fico del dibujo."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "a6b0c06e-25cd-4e20-a3bd-f02041e36cba",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "\n",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "n = 1024\n",
    "X = np.random.normal(0, 1, n)\n",
    "Y = np.random.normal(0, 1, n)\n",
    "plt.scatter(X, Y, c=np.arctan2(Y, X), alpha=0.5, cmap=\"jet\") # este es el cmap m√°s parecido que he encontrado\n",
    "plt.axis([-1.5, 1.5, -1.5, 1.5])\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje X\n",
    "plt.yticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje Y\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eb99c3e3-5800-4701-9a00-8abbb7d57034",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pista: el color viene dado por el √°ngulo que forman x e y con el eje horizontal."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6dd549c2-dec6-4785-8f07-6ff4df53e600",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Pregunta 3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2faa4a50-8521-450a-8c5a-93ffedaf4d19",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A partir del siguiente c√≥digo, intenta obtener el gr√°fico del dibujo."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "197501e3-2411-4c5f-a0e8-93b79daab5fc",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "\n",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "n = 12\n",
    "X = np.arange(n)\n",
    "Y1 = (1 - X / float(n)) * np.random.uniform(0.5, 1.0, n)\n",
    "Y2 = (1 - X / float(n)) * np.random.uniform(0.5, 1.0, n)\n",
    "plt.bar(X, Y1, facecolor = \"#9999ff\", edgecolor = \"white\")\n",
    "plt.bar(X, -Y2, facecolor = \"#ff9999\", edgecolor = \"white\")\n",
    "\n",
    "for x, y in zip(X, Y1):\n",
    "    plt.text(x, y + 0.05, \"%.2f\" % y, ha = \"center\", va = \"bottom\") # eliminado desplazamiento eje X del texto\n",
    "\n",
    "    \n",
    "for x, y in zip(X, Y2):\n",
    "    plt.text(x, - y - 0.15, \"%.2f\" % y, ha = \"center\", va = \"bottom\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.ylim(-1.25, 1.25)\n",
    "    \n",
    "plt.xticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje X\n",
    "plt.yticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje Y\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b0eb8292-667b-469e-8985-a9aaacdd1ca2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pista: cuidado con la alineaci√≥n del texto en el centro de las barras."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5c939fe6-c0fc-4ce7-832e-1057bc84812f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Pregunta 4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7ed45f16-b61d-4fba-9052-f2be2cdb661e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "A partir del siguiente c√≥digo, intenta obtener el gr√°fico del dibujo."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "7e2f0baa-335d-4c61-9147-adf9c91ec9d9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "\n",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "Z = np.ones(20) # generar array de 20 n√∫meros con valores a 1\n",
    "Z[-1] = 1.5 # √∫ltimo quesito tendr√° un tama√±o ligeramente m√°s grande que el resto\n",
    "\n",
    "colors = np.linspace(0, 1, 20) # 20 colores entre el 0 y el 1\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.pie(Z, explode=Z*0.07, # separaci√≥n entre quesitos\n",
    "        colors=[str(x) for x in colors], # a√±adir lista colores en formato string\n",
    "        wedgeprops={\"edgecolor\": \"k\",'linewidth': 0.5}) # borde negro y fino de los quesitos\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje X\n",
    "plt.yticks([], []) # eliminar los valores de los ticks del eje Y\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aa90a827-92b2-4e5e-9cb3-d3732fe7b59a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pista: tendr√°s que modificar la Z."
   ]
  }
 ],
